    "title": "1.6K views \u00b7 54 reactions | Canva is laying off 1,271 employees, around 22% of its global workforce, amid slowing growth and intensifying competition from generative AI platforms. CEO Melanie Perkins described the decision as the \u201chardest moment\u201d in the company\u2019s 13-year history. Affected employees will reportedly receive at least six months\u2019 pay and $10,000 grants to help launch their own businesses. | The Prestige Magazine",
